From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Anton Palgunov <toxblh@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 20:30:15 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 25/99] v8: e2k: add the wide command encoder and the LoongArch
 instruction layer

e2k_asm.h encodes e2k wide commands (checked byte for byte against GNU as),
la_asm.h implements the instruction set of the loong64 Assembler on top of
it: every instruction is one 32-byte slot of e2k code (a few take two).
Both come from v8-e2k-lab, where they are tested by execution.
